WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.830
Someone once said...

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.930
There are clams that taste

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.870
like a mix of succulent clams 
and thick fatty tuna...

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:15.110
Tuna Clams!

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:20.510
There are peanut plants that 
produce sweet marron glace...

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:24.380
Peamarronut Glace!

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:30.220
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:34.890
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:42.170
There are four more training 
ingredients that Ichiryu,

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:43.540
the president of IGO, asked Toriko to get.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.110
In order to capture the Shining Gourami,

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:49.640
Toriko and company went 
to the gigantic waterfall,

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.340
Death Falls, in the Mors Mountains.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:56.380
They headed for the cavern inside Death 
Falls, where Shining Gourami reside,

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.450
but the merciless falls attacked them.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:05.160
Is this a result of his training?

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:08.630
This is what Sunny is now!

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:12.900
Somehow, they made it to 
just before the falls.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.400
They're finally about to take 
the plunge into the falls.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.840
Will they be able to get 
to the cavern within?!

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:26.580
Sunny's New Attack! The 
Result of Gorgeous Training!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.580
Leg...

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.320
...Knife!

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.000
The waterfall is splitting in half!

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.340
Huh. Leg Knife, eh? That's pretty powerful...

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.610
One day, I'd like to catch that 
attack and throw it back at you.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.440
Alright, let's go!

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:07.780
What?! It repelled my Leg Knife?!

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.160
We're going to be crushed!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:13.660
Perfect!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.900
18-fold...

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.400
18?!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.300
...Spiked Punch!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.150
Well, well! 18-fold...

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.950
But it's gettin' thrown back!

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.580
The weight of the water alone is 
several hundred millions tons...

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.490
On top of that, giant mountains

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.220
and Regal Mammoth-class Beasts 
are mixed in with the water!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:51.190
Sunny! Can't you do something?!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.970
Hey! This is no time to be spacin' 
out with a silly grin on your face!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.270
Spacing out, huh?

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.340
So this is the Road of Three Hells.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.980
The road that connects the Gourmet 
World and the Human World...

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.980
It seems like a place that commands 
you to come for training.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.920
You're the one who 
single-handedly stops Beasts

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.650
from making incursions 
into the Human World...

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.990
Guemon, the Gourmet Gang Leader, I presume?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.220
My name is Sunny.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.260
The Gourmet Reviver, Yosaku, 
told me I'd find you here.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.930
I want to see your power!

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:49.520
What the...?!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.790
He doesn't seem to be aware of me at all...

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.720
Like he hasn't noticed me...

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:03.960
You scared the life outta me!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.430
Who the hell are you?! How 
long have you been there?!

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.770
He really didn't notice me?!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.140
I see, I see! Old Yosaku, huh?!

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:21.180
But it's been years since any other 
human's set foot here, y'know?!

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:24.180
Hey! How many years has it been?! Huh?!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.420
Oh, I don't know...

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:27.490
I don't know either!

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:31.360
What's with this old man?

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.490
Wait a second. Who's this Yosaku?

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.100
Before, you called him "Old Yosaku"!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:39.760
But when I think about 
it, I don't remember him.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.600
Probably because I've been spacing out 
here all alone for years and years...

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.700
I've forgotten almost everything.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.040
Spacing out?! Here?!

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:52.010
Old man, this is the Road of Three Hells!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.110
The road that connects the 
Gourmet and Human Worlds!

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:56.350
If you space out in a place like this...

00:06:57.210 --> 00:07:00.020
Oh, there you go spacing out!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.530
What?! Is this Beast from the Gourmet World?!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.070
Hey, old man! One's coming over!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.010
From the Gourmet World, so 
what are you going to do?!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.110
Is this guy for real?! 
He's totally out of it!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.550
Hey, old man! Hey! What are you looking at?!

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.080
Hey! Wake up...

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.050
Dammit, old man!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.020
Hair Lock!

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:53.370
Did I do it?

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.240
That didn't stop it!

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.440
Gourmet World monsters really 
are in a different league!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.410
Wha...?!

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.050
What the...?! You're <i>still</i> in a trance?!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:49.060
How did you do that, without even thinking?!

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.930
Hey, Sunny! What are you smiling 
about at a time like this?!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.600
Oh, just looking forward to testing 
this thing's destructive force.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:58.830
Looking forward to it?

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.730
My Spatula has always been a skill

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:04.640
that turns the power of an 
enemy's attack against them,

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.310
but my evolved Spatula multiplies the power

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.580
of the enemy's attack and 
fires it back at them.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:13.250
Moreover, the attack's power is in 
proportion to the number of hair sensors.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.220
Just two strands were plenty 
against that creature from before.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.020
But against these falls, I'd 
better prepare five strands.

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:23.790
So that's the reason you've been acting 
so confident since we started out...

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:26.430
Oh, I don't feel especially confident.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.490
I'm just not thinking about anything.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.800
Here it comes!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.100
Okay, here I go! This is 
the result of my training!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:41.710
Take this! 5x Super Spatula!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:06.460
Take this! 5x Super Spatula!

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.270
A-Awesome!

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.980
With one kilometer-thick falls,

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.350
I suppose we can't expect 
to see the cavern from here,

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.080
but now we can at least move ahead a little.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.250
Sunny-san, you're too incredible!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.260
That was so cool! Seriously, too cool!

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.460
Call it "beautiful". "Beautiful".

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:38.800
Super Spatula... So that's what 
you got out of training...

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:39.430
What can I say?

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.000
The power of a waterfall isn't fixed.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.470
It should've taken tremendous 
concentration to turn it around.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.900
And to multiply its force 
and then send it back...

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.140
I'm impressed you could do it while 
relaxed, not thinking of anything.

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:54.040
I did it by instinct.

00:10:54.740 --> 00:10:55.710
Instinct?

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.410
That's right. Instinct!

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.630
How, when you're still spaced out?!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.440
It's like you know how I'm 
going to attack before I do it!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.610
So you control your hair, which 
serves as sensory nerves, eh?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:33.580
It's like he has the sensory functions 
of his hand in each and every strand...

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.690
It's all I can do to 
control my own two arms...

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.090
But with your sensors,

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.120
it's as if you're operating tens 
of thousands of arms at will.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.160
The concentration you possess 
for that is admirable.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:51.700
But by the same token, that 
concentration is your problem.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:52.630
What?!

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:56.500
I'm not some child who just learned 
to hold chopsticks yesterday!

00:11:57.100 --> 00:12:00.670
I can move my sensors and focus 
on the enemy at the same time!

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.780
Focusing on the enemy...

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.910
That's another reason 
you're still an amateur.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:06.610
What?!

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.250
You think too much.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:16.020
Well, to train you, I suppose we'll just 
have to keep doing this over and over.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.190
Who are you calling an amateur?!

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:23.760
Spacing out again...

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.270
Don't underestimate me, old man!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:32.940
What's that?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.540
Hair Punch!

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:49.790
This old man really isn't thinking anything?!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:53.360
It looks like he's just gazing at me blankly!

00:13:01.430 --> 00:13:02.000
Wha...?!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.250
H-How did you know I was going 
to attack from underground?!

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.950
You obviously just dodged my attack 
right now before it came...

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.790
How?! How can you do that without 
thinking about anything?!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:29.790
A hunch, I suppose.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:30.760
A hunch?!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.260
Liar! How is that possible?!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:36.130
A hunch! What do you mean by that?!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.440
Well, "instinct" is probably a better word...

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:39.440
Instinct?!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:43.310
Yes. All of my movements 
are based on instinct.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:48.010
When I face off against an enemy, the 
best action I can take pops into my head.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.920
I don't think of anything else but that.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.550
Because it would be a waste...

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:55.120
What?!

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:56.720
Haven't you ever heard?

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:02.190
Pro sports players or shogi champions 
don't think about their best move,

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:03.960
but move according to their instinct.

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:07.160
Long training and years of experience

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:11.030
have made them able to choose the 
best course of action naturally.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.640
Pros don't think. They feel.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.240
Do you understand?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.040
You're still an amateur!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.710
This is so vexing! He's ticking me off!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.660
Another attack from the Gourmet 
World, and this time a herd of them!

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:37.590
I haven't seen these 
before. Flying sharks, eh?

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.860
Wonderful! We can have 
shark fin soup tonight!

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:46.300
D-Does instinct work even against something 
you're seeing for the first time?

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:50.040
Of course! Instincts aren't innate.

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:53.140
They come about through an incredible 
amount of training and experience.

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:59.280
Ever since I was young, I'd spend 
all my time fighting, every day.

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:02.220
That experience is what 
makes my instinct work.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:17.060
The first time you saw a Beast, but you 
knew its weak point... by instinct?!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:21.870
Looks like we'll have as much shark 
fin soup as we can stomach tonight!

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.870
I'll leave the cooking to 
you. I forgot how to make it.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:28.540
Did I ever know how? I forgot that, too.

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.010
Spacing out again!

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.410
Alright, I'll follow the old man's 
example, without thinking...

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.730
You tried to kickstart your instinct by 
telling yourself not to think, didn't you?

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.690
No good! I was thinking!

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:51.960
Well, I suppose it's not something 
you can do right off the bat.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:57.040
To keep from thinking, do I need to 
make that spaced-out face like you do?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:57.940
Excuse me?

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:02.010
If that's the case, I really don't know 
if I'll be able to get to "no thinking"!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.040
A spaced-out face isn't a beautiful face!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.350
Is that what you were thinking?!

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:11.180
That face doesn't work!

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:14.050
I just can't do spaced-out! 
It's not beautiful!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.420
Don't focus on trivialities. Just 
let yourself become absorbed!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:18.090
Absorbed...

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.190
Without thinking...

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.140
There ya go!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:40.110
Well, I've had my share of battle experience.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.210
But...

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:44.580
It's coming again?!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.540
You suddenly thought about how you 
were going to move, didn't you?

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.180
Of course it works against Beasts that 
I've laid eyes on for the first time...

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.410
But also water and natural objects...

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.160
In fact, my instinct has developed

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:29.330
to where it works on vapors that 
I can't see, like pheromones.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.200
Water and even gases...

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:38.000
I guess I really don't have 
enough experience fighting...

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:42.770
Alright, finished! Thank you for the food!

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:46.170
Delicious!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.480
It's stuff like that that makes it impossible

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.050
for me to quit guardin' 
the Road of Three Hells!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:00.820
I told you. Instinct isn't 
somethin' you're born with.

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:05.390
Well, there are creatures 
like the Battle Wolf,

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.160
that possess natural instincts 
when it comes to combat,

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.300
but basically, the power 
of instinct is produced

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.700
by an enormous amount of 
training and experience.

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:17.410
Enormous amount of training and experience...

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:22.680
Hurry up and eat before the next Beast comes.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:28.120
On most days, several hundred 
Beasts come this way.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.380
That's some good training, wouldn't you say?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.620
When you stop thinking,

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:36.490
I bet that along with instinct,

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:39.990
you'll be able to marshal even more 
power with that ability of yours.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:44.130
Old man!

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:50.300
Hey, come on! Just when you 
started to sound cool...

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.810
They've come already?

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:03.380
Guemon told me that what's 
important is believing.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.120
Believing?!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:10.520
Yeah. We start by believing in the 
small instinct we already have.

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:12.860
The more your instinct is right,

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:16.100
the less needless thoughts and 
wasteful actions you'll have.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:23.240
That's how you create a mind and 
body that performs even better.

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:28.740
Before I knew it, I could control my 
sensors without feeling any stress.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.080
The moment my useless thoughts 
disappeared and I relaxed,

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.580
the quality of my ability rose.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:38.580
Right now, I can control all 300,000 
strands up to nearly 50 meters.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:43.520
So that instinct even tells you about 
the flow of a waterfall's power, huh?

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.290
You even know the flow of a waterfall...?

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:49.130
Very impressive, Sunny!

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:50.390
Yeah, well...

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.460
Then I'll believe in that instinct, too!

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:13.580
18 plus 18...

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:20.620
You...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:24.290
Take this... 36-fold...

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:28.330
...Twin Spiked Punch!

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.960
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:38.500
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.940
We're going to use a camera 
again later, so get yours ready!

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.210
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:51.110
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:54.920
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:57.650
Alright, here we go!

00:21:58.180 --> 00:21:58.990
A heaping helping...

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:01.920
Open!

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.960
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:09.300
...yours if you chose B!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:12.970
If you go outside, you may meet 
a delicious, delightful person!

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:16.600
If you chose A, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:18.100
Even if it's something you're not good at,

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:19.740
try to challenge yourself with 
a heaping helping of effort!

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:23.380
And, I'm sorry. If you chose C, you're third.

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:26.080
Be careful about sounding selfish!

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:28.910
Try to appreciate everything.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:32.480
Alright, finally it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:32.920 --> 00:22:34.090
Are you ready?

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:37.990
One of Toriko's friends is going 
to say a few words of wisdom.

00:22:37.820 --> 00:22:43.360
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:39.890
If you take a photo of that scene

00:22:39.890 --> 00:22:43.090
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:43.660 --> 00:22:45.060
Alright, here we go!

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:45.800
Three!

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:46.800
Two!

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:47.730
One!

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:49.270
Scoop chance!

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:51.400
Believe in your instinct!

00:22:52.640 --> 00:22:53.970
Believe in your instinct!

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:56.570
Believe in your instinct...

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:02.250
I'm gonna space out and let 
my instincts take over...

00:23:02.780 --> 00:23:04.320
We should probably go on 
to the next segment, right?

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:10.390
The Death Falls continue to shower down new challenges... Wait, a mountain this time!?

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:13.260
Behold, the Four Heavenly Kings new team-up technique!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:17.330
Thirty Times Combo! Thirty-Six-Fold Twin Spiked Punch!

00:23:17.550 --> 00:23:19.340
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
